That was where I made, that was where I lived for most of the series, that the show bought me that house, just a modest little house in Culver City, by the way.
那是我拍摄大部分剧集时住的地方，剧组给我买了那栋房子，顺便说一下，只是卡尔弗城一栋朴素的小房子。

