00:31:13.099 --> 00:31:25.470
card from 2021 or whatever she'd like, take a picture of it, put a file, get a file of these are things that mean something to you on your phone, take a picture of it, throw out the actual thing.
2021年的卡片之类的，她会说，拍张照，存个档，在手机里建个文件夹，存下这些对你有意义的东西，然后把实物扔掉。

