00:32:02.779 --> 00:32:08.539
But once you've thrown the thing out and that lighter feeling is, I move a lot.
但一旦你把东西扔掉，那种轻松的感觉，我经常搬家。

00:32:08.779 --> 00:32:09.743
so I purge a lot.
