00:50:16.596 --> 00:50:29.783
Alec, can you while I'm reading this letter look up of when Fierro's ceased to be made, which I feel like it was a while ago, and less, and then it's even worse slander if it, if I'm saying they're not made anywhere and are, so we'll edit this all out.
Alec，在我读这封信的时候，你能查一下Fiero是什么时候停产的吗？我觉得是很久以前的事了，如果我还在说他们没在生产，那简直是在造谣，所以我们到时候会把这些剪掉。

