开始了。

00:50:30.359 --> 00:50:32.138
Back to Trashing Fieros via Raspi.
回到通过Raspi吐槽Fiero的话题。

00:50:32.138 --> 00:50:36.167
This episode of Hymian was actually the first episode of the show I ever saw.
《How I Met Your Mother》的这一集其实是我看过的第一集。

00:50:36.167 --> 00:50:42.500
As I was looking for a YouTube video about Fieros, I stumbled upon a clip from this episode and decided I would watch it.
当时我在YouTube上搜索关于Fiero的视频，偶然发现了这一集的片段，于是决定看一看。

00:50:42.500 --> 00:50:50.703
As you can imagine, having not seen any of the previous episodes, I was very confused and just assumed Lillian Robin were super enthusiastic about origami.
你们可以想象，因为没看过之前的剧集，我当时非常困惑，还以为Lillian和Robin对折纸艺术超级狂热。

00:50:50.703 --> 00:50:56.260
I'm currently a sophomore in in Michigan, and I'm very happy, but before college, I was nervous about it.
我现在是密歇根州的一名大二学生，过得很开心，但在上大学之前，我对此感到很紧张。

00:50:56.260 --> 00:51:00.780
As an Oklahoman, my college plan required that I pick up everything and move.
作为一个俄克拉荷马人，我的大学计划要求我收拾行囊，搬到外地。

00:51:00.780 --> 00:51:12.530
It was an all-new experience with an all-new location and all-new people, and I wanted something that I knew, something that reminded me of who I was, as I was bombarded with new things, like Marshall, so I took my Fierro.
那是一个全新的环境、全新的地点和全新的人，我想要一些我熟悉的东西，一些能提醒我我是谁的东西，因为我当时被各种新事物轰炸，就像Marshall一样，所以我带上了我的Fiero。

00:51:12.530 --> 00:51:18.050
The first week of college was difficult, and meeting new people was not my specialty, nor was it going well.
大学第一周很艰难，结识新朋友不是我的强项，进展也不顺利。

00:51:18.050 --> 00:51:27.090
on my first weekend at college, I got in my Fierro and drove as far from campus as I could, but I only made it about 30 minutes before my Fierro's engine turned off and would not turn back on.
在大学的第一个周末，我坐进我的Fiero，尽可能地远离校园，但只开了大约30分钟，我的Fiero引擎就熄火了，再也发动不起来。

00:51:28.610 --> 00:51:35.911
I was obviously devastated, however, just like Marshall's Fierro gave him a token of appreciation in its final moments.
我显然崩溃了，然而，就像Marshall的Fiero在最后时刻给了他一份感激的礼物一样。

00:51:35.911 --> 00:51:40.575
I too was given a gift before my poor car was diagnosed with engine failure.
在我的破车被诊断出引擎故障之前，我也收到了一份礼物。

00:51:40.575 --> 00:51:43.336
I was given my very first friends at college.
我得到了我在大学里的第一批朋友。

00:51:43.336 --> 00:51:52.356
Having been stranded in the middle of nowhere, Michigan, I called the number of the only person I had talked to at any length during my first week.
被困在密歇根州荒无人烟的地方，我拨通了我在第一周里唯一聊过天的人的电话。

00:51:52.356 --> 00:51:55.669
And she and some of her friends came and picked me up.
她和她的几个朋友过来接了我。

00:51:55.669 --> 00:51:59.780
So in place of a cassette tape, I was given my first three friends.
所以，我得到的不是一盘磁带，而是我的前三个朋友。

00:51:59.780 --> 00:52:07.020
And so when I watched this episode and I mourn for my car alongside Marshall, I drank a hypothetical celebratory beer.
所以当我看到这一集，和Marshall一起为我的车哀悼时，我喝了一杯假设性的庆祝啤酒。

00:52:07.020 --> 00:52:08.248
I'm not 21 yet, huh?
我还没满21岁，哈？

