Thank you, Ross, and RIP your Fierro.
谢谢你，Ross，愿你的Fiero安息。

00:52:21.774 --> 00:52:22.274
I know.
我知道。

00:52:22.274 --> 00:52:22.774
RIP.
安息吧。

00:52:22.774 --> 00:52:28.787
The last of which rolled off the lines on August 16th, 1988, two days shy of Fred's 13th birthday.
最后一辆车是在1988年8月16日下线的，离Fred的13岁生日还差两天。

00:52:29.389 --> 00:52:30.111
I'm funny.
我真幽默。

00:52:30.111 --> 00:52:33.503
We're like, oh, don't offend the Fierro makers.
我们当时还在想，哦，别冒犯了Fiero的制造商。

00:52:33.503 --> 00:52:36.030
