他们从1988年起就不干这行了。

00:52:36.030 --> 00:52:38.510
I would have guessed like the 90s or early 2000s.
我本来会猜是90年代或2000年代初。

00:52:38.510 --> 00:52:41.630
I did not realize it went, I mean, I guess we know why.
我没意识到它停产那么早，我是说，我想我们知道原因。

00:52:41.630 --> 00:52:45.269
They're not the most reliable car, but they looked cool and there's a cool name.
它们不是最可靠的车，但它们看起来很酷，而且名字也很酷。

00:52:45.269 --> 00:52:46.550
So.
所以。

00:52:46.550 --> 00:52:51.949
I bet for car people, like for real car people, my friend Kia is like a car guy.
我敢打赌，对于爱车人士，比如我朋友Kia，他是个车迷。

00:52:51.949 --> 00:52:54.269
I bet fieros are like some of the most fit.
我敢打赌Fiero是那种最……

00:52:54.269 --> 00:52:57.150
Like you spot a fiero and you're a car person.
就像你看到一辆Fiero，如果你是个车迷。

00:52:57.150 --> 00:52:57.989
Yeah, yeah, yeah.
对，对，对。

00:52:57.989 --> 00:52:58.949
You'd be thrilled.
你会很兴奋。

00:52:58.949 --> 00:53:00.070
Yeah, totally.
是的，完全同意。

00:53:00.070 --> 00:53:01.670
How did you land on fiero?
你们是怎么选定Fiero的？

00:53:01.670 --> 00:53:03.469
Like where'd that come from?
那是怎么来的？

00:53:03.469 --> 00:53:04.309
I don't remember.
我不记得了。

00:53:04.309 --> 00:53:05.429
Maybe it was Chris's choice.
也许是Chris的选择。

00:53:05.429 --> 00:53:10.550
I think we just wanted something that was very dated and turns out to even be old in the 90s, right?
我想我们只是想要一些非常过时，甚至在90年代就已经很老的东西，对吧？

00:53:10.550 --> 00:53:17.070
When Marshall got this in the early mid 90s from his brothers, it didn't stop being made years earlier.
当Marshall在90年代中期从他兄弟那里得到这辆车时，它已经停产好几年了。

00:53:17.070 --> 00:53:22.469
I think we're looking for something that was old and kind of cool.
我想我们是在找一些既老又有点酷的东西。

00:53:22.469 --> 00:53:28.070
And it was also like cool at one moment and just like, yeah.
而且它在某个时刻确实很酷，然后就……是啊。

00:53:28.070 --> 00:53:30.510
I think just the name, honestly, the name Firo.
我觉得就是名字，老实说，Fiero这个名字。

00:53:30.510 --> 00:53:31.630
It's just a cool name.
这名字真的很酷。

00:53:31.630 --> 00:53:34.309
It was maybe not the, it's like Baba Garniz.
也许不是……就像Baba Garniz。

00:53:34.309 --> 00:53:39.469
If you're going to say that over a lot of times make the title, it's got to be a cool word.
如果你要反复说它，把它作为标题，它必须是一个很酷的词。

00:53:39.469 --> 00:53:40.469
Yeah.
是啊。

00:53:40.469 --> 00:53:41.469
Yeah.
是啊。

00:53:41.469 --> 00:53:42.469
Well, if you want, we have one more letter to read that's terrific.
好吧，如果你愿意，我们还有最后一封很棒的信要读。

